@Identity_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Health / Ping (no auth)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/admin/ping
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/owners/ping
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Auth
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Register
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Login
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### After login, copy the tokens into these variables
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Current user (requires Bearer token)
GET {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Refresh (uses refresh token)
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout (revoke one refresh token)
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout from all devices (revoke all refresh tokens for the user)
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout-all
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Email confirmation / password reset (DEV flow for now)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Confirm Email
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID_HERE",
  "token": "PASTE_CONFIRMATION_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### Forgot Password
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com"
}

###

### Reset Password
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "PASTE_USER_ID_HERE",
  "token": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Restaurant owner requests (requires auth; approval likely admin)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### Request restaurant owner (current user)
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/owners/requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### List owner requests (likely admin-only)
GET {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/owners/requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Approve owner request (likely admin-only)
POST {{Identity_API_HostAddress}}/api/owners/requests/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com"
}